    "Condition : 1 - The proposed extensions due to their size, scale, position, appearance, and creating a terracing effect, would not be in keeping with the character and style of the existing house and surrounding properties.  This would be harmful to the appearance of the area and also harmful to neighbouring residents' living conditions by having an overbearing appearance and through loss of outlook.  It would therefore be contrary to policies ENV-B.1.1 (All New Development), H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations), and supplementary guidance for Residential Extension Guidelines, of the adopted Hounslow Unitary Development Plan."
